<title>JAPAN: Kawasaki Safety - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kawasaki Safety - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.00		vs	    4.30</p>
<p> Operating	   16    million    vs	    5    million</p>
<p> Current	    prft 1 million    vs    loss 10    million</p>
<p> Net	     loss 3    million    vs    loss 15    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 35.00 yen	  vs     loss 1.56 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Kawasaki Safety Service Industries Ltd is a maker of fire exinguishing and medical systems, as well as respiratory equipment.</p>
